          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Key configuration considerations:</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The <code>Runner</code> will need the following services\nto enable memory functionality:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>session_service</code>: Manages conversation threads\nand events</li>\n<li><code>memory_service</code>: Provides long-term knowledge\nstorage</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Both work together: Sessions capture convos,\nMemory stores knowledge for retreival across\nsessions.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
